From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:37:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Full-screen DJ booth page + paired slide remote
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Full-screen DJ booth  /hanns/screen/s/<token>/dj/  (owner only)
- the booth on its own page, edge to edge; opened from the card header,
  the Music & video row, or the booth itself (one named tab per screen)
- "Start the booth" = one tap: full screen, sound unlocked, wake lock
- Screen Wake Lock, re-taken when the tab comes back; a 2 KB silent
  looping video keeps older iPhones awake; Add-to-Home-Screen tip on iOS
- live over the screen socket with a polling backstop (hanns_dj_page.js)

Paired slide remote  (hanns/remote.py)
- a phone pairs at /hanns/screen/remote/ with the screen code; it gets a
  match symbol (e.g. "Amber Giraffe") that also shows on the projector
  lobby and the control board, where the host approves or denies
- approved → lock on: only that phone drives slides of the deck on that
  screen. PIN / control-code phones and presenter laptops are refused,
  told why, and snapped back to the room's slide; the screen's own
  embedded stage may still resync. Lock off / unpair → as before
- the remote opens the existing controller (notes, reveals, zoom...) and
  follows the screen when the deck changes; unpair kicks it at once
- stored in ScreenStyle.settings["remote"], secrets only as SHA-256;
  cookie is HttpOnly; code entry throttled; ≤3 waiting requests
- consumer: remote:<secret> credential, frame identification, a gate on
  every slide-driving message, screen.lock_changed fan-out
- control board row (QR, approve/deny, lock switch, unpair), projector
  match card, presenter-screen lock notice; tests incl. WebSocket tests

Fixes found on the way
- deck_control now sets the CSRF cookie: a phone arriving fresh from the
  controller QR got 403 on the PIN unlock ("Could not reach the server")
- the controller's CODE box stayed visible after connecting
  (hanns.css display:flex beat [hidden])
